Domain: NMG.com
OUs created: Finance, HR, IT, Operations
Security groups created: Finance-Users, HR-Users, Operations-Users
Purpse of each OU: Finance - Holds user accounts and resources for the Finance department, To manage all the financial documents for the organization.
HR - Holds user accounts and resources for the Human Resource department, keeping their permissions separate from other teams.
IT - Holds user accounts and resources for the IT department, including accounts that may need elevated administrative permissions.
Operations - Holds user accounts and resources for the Operations department, separating their access from other business functions.
